# The milestones, in release order. A bare version line opens a milestone and
# the item ids under it are its finish line; the first milestone is the current
# one, the product goal. The queue script ranks every open item on a listed
# id's dependency path with its milestone, earlier milestones first, and the
# work-item mirror labels the current milestone's items `goal`. Lines starting
# with # are comments. docs/roadmap.md says what each milestone makes better.
# Open finish lines name child items explicitly; Feature containers remain
# delivery summaries so newly cut children do not silently enlarge a release.

